<h2>Frequently asked questions</h2><h3>When did OpenAI add the Data plugin?</h3><p>OpenAI announced the Data plugin on September 10, 2026 for ChatGPT Work and Codex.</p><h3>Does Data bypass existing permissions?</h3><p>OpenAI says connected queries use the permissions of the connected account or source, so the plugin should be treated as a layer over existing access controls.</p><h3>Can Data create dashboards?</h3><p>Yes. OpenAI says the plugin can help create interactive dashboards or reports from connected business data.</p>
